00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:24.840
This is their Alchemist, code name,

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:29.550
first generation ARC flagship, the A770.

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:35.160
And ooh, it comes with important safety

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:37.246
and regulatory information.

00:00:37.246 --> 00:00:39.090
Neat.

