- All right, let's just.

00:04:18.424 --> 00:04:19.980
Yeah, what could go wrong?

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:21.600
Uh, that could go wrong.

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:22.489
One thing to note is that,

00:04:22.489 --> 00:04:25.140
probably because it was intended
to come out a lot sooner,

00:04:25.140 --> 00:04:27.510
the ARC series does
not use any of the new,

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:30.030
funky PCI-e power connectors,
it just has a standard

00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:31.530
eight pin plus six pin.

00:04:31.530 --> 00:04:34.295
Oh, and that USB is right here.

00:04:34.295 --> 00:04:37.147
Is that what that USB connector is for?

00:04:37.147 --> 00:04:40.440
I thought I remember them
telling me that it was for RGB,

