It's the top tier flagship level card.

00:05:48.137 --> 00:05:50.212
Hmm, it's pretty big.

00:05:50.212 --> 00:05:53.203
It's almost as big as a 3080 Ti.

00:05:53.203 --> 00:05:55.530
Here's a 3060 Ti.

